ECUP product-category classifier, solution A.

This source release references Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B. Qwen model files are not
included. The trained adapter is a derived model artifact and is distributed,
if at all, separately from this source tree.

Official competition data, images, curated product cards, predictions and
training logs are intentionally excluded. Users must obtain those artifacts
through channels that grant them the required rights.

